# FIRMWARE_SNAPSHOT regression (tests/headless, firmware-snapshot): reads
# every table of the kernel's sealed boot copy of the ACPI tables. The
# startup plan must approve the reader, (firmware-snapshot approve-declared);
# the same image started without that approval must be refused at launch.
# "acpi" is the ACPI service's client endpoint, badged by procmgr with
# ACPI_Protocol.Observer_Tag (the test's acpi-standin.app provides it).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.firmware-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (Request.Firmware_Snapshot "tables")
    (service "acpi" "acpi")])
